# CRM = CRM-PrepCorex

When the user mentions **CRM**, **PrepCorex CRM**, or **crm prepcorex**, they mean the **standalone CRM app**, not PSF StockFlow / PrepCorex warehouse.

## Canonical project

- **GitHub:** https://github.com/digitaltechyx/CRM-PrepCorex
- **Local path (typical):** `C:\Users\zains\Desktop\Sir Arhsad Iqbal\PSF StockFlow\CRM-PrepCorex`
- **Hosts:** `https://crm.prepservicesfba.com`, `https://crm-prep-corex.vercel.app`
- **Data:** same Firebase as StockFlow; leads live in Firestore `crmLeads` (+ `timeline` subcollection)

## Do not confuse with

- PrepCorex warehouse / StockFlow (`PSF-StockFlow-main`, remotes `PrepCorex` / `Dev.PrepCorex`)
- Marketing / Buy Labels / warehouse ops features in StockFlow
- StockFlow’s thin `crmAddressBook` / b-card capture unless bridging into CRM

## When implementing CRM work

- Edit and push in the **CRM-PrepCorex** repo (`origin` → `digitaltechyx/CRM-PrepCorex`)
- Lead fields: `leadName`, `status`, `nextFollowUpAt`, timeline `text` / `type` / `at`
- ChatGPT automation API lives under `src/app/api/crm/` in CRM-PrepCorex; auth via `CRM_AUTOMATION_API_KEY`
